{"id": "225317", "name": "תוחלת של X+Y – התפלגות אחידה על עיגול", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:6px\">הנתונים</div><p>יהא <span dir=\"ltr\">\\((X,Y)\\)</span> משתנה מקרי רציף המתפלג אחיד על התחום</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[D=\\{ (x,y) \\in \\mathbb{R}^2 \\ : \\ x^2+y^2 \\leq {{CT:0}} \\}\\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><p>חשבו את <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\mathbb{E}[X+Y]\\)</span>.</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">[[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">מבנה הפתרון:</b> מנצלים את הסימטריה של העיגול ואת לינאריות התוחלת.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 1 — סימטריה</b><br>העיגול <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(D\\)</span> סימטרי ביחס לשיקוף <span dir=\"ltr\">\\((x,y)\\mapsto(-x,y)\\)</span>, ולכן ל-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(X\\)</span> ול-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(-X\\)</span> אותה התפלגות. <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(X\\)</span> חסום (<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(|X|\\le {{CT:1}}\\)</span>), ולכן התוחלת קיימת, ו-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\mathbb{E}[X]=\\mathbb{E}[-X]=-\\mathbb{E}[X]\\)</span>, כלומר <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\mathbb{E}[X]=0\\)</span>. באותו אופן (שיקוף <span dir=\"ltr\">\\((x,y)\\mapsto(x,-y)\\)</span>) <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\mathbb{E}[Y]=0\\)</span>.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 2 — לינאריות התוחלת</b><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\mathbb{E}[X+Y]=\\mathbb{E}[X]+\\mathbb{E}[Y]=0 \\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "[[feedback:prt1]]", "prtcorrect": "Correct answer, well done.", "prtpartiallycorrect": "Your answer is partially correct.", "prtincorrect": "Incorrect answer.", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "checkbox", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": false, "showvalidation": 0, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": "LaTeXdisplaystyle"}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "mcq_correct(ta)", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["o1", "o2", "o3", "o4", "q", "r", "ta", "tam"], "nvariants": 50}